sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Customer
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI /api/v1
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant GW as Sandbox Payment

    C->>FE: Confirm Checkout (Address, Coupon, SANDBOX, Idempotency-Key)
    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/orders
    API->>DB: BEGIN TX + Check Idempotency-Key
    API->>DB: Lock inventory & non-expired batches (ORDER BY expiry_date ASC)
    API->>DB: Reserve stock, create Order + OrderItems + Payment (PAYMENT_PENDING)
    DB-->>API: COMMIT
    API-->>FE: 201 Created (order_id, payment_id)

    C->>FE: Complete Sandbox Payment
    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/payments
    API->>GW: Create Sandbox Charge / Redirect Token
    GW-->>API: POST /api/v1/payments/webhook (HMAC signature + provider_event_id)
    API->>DB: Verify signature & unique provider_event_id
    API->>DB: Mark Payment PAID, Order PAID, Deduct FEFO batches, Log SOLD movement
    DB-->>API: COMMIT
    API-->>FE: 200 OK (Order PAID)

